<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Reset Password - Lentera Sosmed</title>

  <style>
    * {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    body {
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', 'Roboto', sans-serif;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea 0%, #764ba2 100%);
      min-height: 100vh;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: center;
      padding: 20px;
    }

    .wrapper {
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 520px;
    }

    .container {
      background: #ffffff;
      border-radius: 20px;
      box-shadow: 0 20px 60px rgba(102, 126, 234, 0.4);
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .header {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea 0%, #764ba2 100%);
      padding: 40px 30px;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .header-icon {
      font-size: 56px;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }

    .header h1 {
      font-size: 28px;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: #ffffff;
    }

    .header-subtitle {
      font-size: 14px;
      color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.9);
      margin-top: 6px;
    }

    .content {
      padding: 35px 30px;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .greeting {
      font-size: 18px;
      color: #1a202c;
      font-weight: 600;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
    }

    .message {
      font-size: 15px;
      color: #4a5568;
      line-height: 1.8;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
    }

    .otp-box {
      background: #f7fafc;
      border: 2px dashed #667eea;
      border-radius: 14px;
      padding: 20px;
      margin: 24px 0;
    }

    .otp-label {
      font-size: 13px;
      color: #718096;
      font-weight: 600;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.5px;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }

    .otp-code {
      font-size: 36px;
      font-weight: 800;
      letter-spacing: 8px;
      color: #2563eb;
      font-family: 'Courier New', monospace;
    }

    .warning {
      font-size: 13px;
      color: #e53e3e;
      margin-top: 16px;
      font-weight: 600;
    }

    .footer {
      background-color: #f7fafc;
      padding: 22px 30px;
      text-align: center;
      border-top: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
    }

    .footer-text {
      font-size: 13px;
      color: #718096;
      line-height: 1.7;
    }

    .footer-brand {
      font-size: 11px;
      color: #a0aec0;
      margin-top: 10px;
    }

    @media (max-width: 480px) {
      .otp-code {
        font-size: 28px;
        letter-spacing: 6px;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>
  <div class="wrapper">
    <div class="container">

      <!-- Header -->
      <div class="header">
        <div class="header-icon">🔐</div>
        <h1>Reset Password</h1>
        <p class="header-subtitle">
          Kode OTP untuk mengatur ulang kata sandi Anda
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Content -->
      <div class="content">
        <div class="greeting">
          Halo <strong>{{ name }}</strong> 👋
        </div>

        <div class="message">
          Kami menerima permintaan untuk mengatur ulang kata sandi akun
          <strong>Lentera Sosmed</strong> Anda.  
          Gunakan kode OTP di bawah ini untuk melanjutkan proses reset password.
        </div>

        <!-- OTP -->
        <div class="otp-box">
          <div class="otp-label">Kode OTP Anda</div>
          <div class="otp-code">{{ otp }}</div>
        </div>

        <div class="message">
          Masukkan kode OTP ini pada halaman reset password di aplikasi.
        </div>

        <div class="warning">
          ⏱️ Kode OTP ini hanya berlaku selama <strong>10 menit</strong>.
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Footer -->
      <div class="footer">
        <p class="footer-text">
          Jika Anda tidak merasa melakukan permintaan reset password,
          silakan <strong>abaikan email ini</strong>.
        </p>
        <p class="footer-brand">
          © 2026 <strong>Lentera Sosmed</strong> — All rights reserved
        </p>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
